#indent 4

//: # check/module/memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer
//: typed public impl record から `MemoKey` / `MemoValue` operation impl candidate builder input を[作/つく]る checker-layer materializer です。
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - actual public surface materializer が後続 stage で作る public impl record を、既存の impl candidate builder が読む typed input table へ変換します。
//: - public impl header、trait application、resolved target type shape、optional method body root、fuel を 1 record にまとめ、source text や method name string に戻らず candidate builder へ渡します。
//: - operation kind は caller supplied field ではなく、trusted operation classifier が返す shape-bound evidence から採用します。
//: - この module は method body fact、Drop proof、operation evidence record、aggregate proof status を作りません。candidate table owner への接続は既存 `memo_trait_operation_impl_candidate_builder` に委譲します。
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - accepted authority は `SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerRecordTable` の typed field、connector input table を使ってこの module 内で実行した `connector_result`、`SelfhostHirModule` borrow、operation classifier、candidate builder boundary だけです。
//: - source text、span、lexeme、display name、diagnostic text、module path、method name string、trait name string、public surface hash から operation や HIR root を推測しません。
//: - `type_id`、public impl header input、trait application input、resolved target shape、method body root、fuel は上流 materializer が型検査済み evidence として渡します。この module はそれらを raw source から再構築しません。
//: - public impl header producer が header を拒否した場合は、candidate builder input を作らず `HeaderRejected` として fail-closed にします。
//: - connector table を受け取らない既存 API では、detailed generic binder evidence を持つ record は header evidence までは検査しますが、operation candidate へは流さず `GenericImplInstantiationUnsupported` として拒否します。
//: - connector input table を受け取る generic-aware API では、matching input を見つけた後に `memo_trait_public_impl_generic_materializer_connector` の `connector_result` を実行し、concrete target TypeId と final target / trait shape を使う場合だけ builder input へ進めます。
//: - classifier が trait source と trait application shape の不一致を返した場合は、candidate builder input を作らず `ClassifierRejected` として fail-closed にします。
//: - `source` record table と `module` は borrow です。この module はどちらも閉じません。
//: - 内部で作る builder input table owner は、この module が success / failure の両方で閉じます。success の場合だけ output candidate table owner を caller へ返します。
//: - Drop operation はこの module では特別に受理しません。Drop record が現れた場合、classifier で shape を確認したうえで builder input に写し、既存 builder の `DropOperationUnsupportedUntilResourceProof` によって Resource proof 未接続の fail-closed 境界へ送ります。
//: - HIR は candidate builder が method body fact を作るために borrow するだけです。Resource IR、backend artifact、proof store、`.neplproof` reader / serializer、canonical key codec には依存しません。
//:
//: [現状/げんじょう]:
//: - Phase 1 では actual AST / typed HIR public impl scanner はまだ未接続です。この module は、その scanner が作るべき typed record table の境界を先に固定します。
//: - full public surface materialization、trait coherence の完全な overlap solver、Drop body effect checker、Resource IR no-escape proof、Copy / Drop / Eq / Hash pure evidence の実計算は後続 slice の責務です。
//: - facade にはまだ re-export しません。full operation evidence orchestration が public surface materializer と proof boundary をまとめる段階で公開範囲を再評価します。
//:
//: [計算量/けいさんりょう]:
//: - materializer record 数を m とすると、builder input table への変換は O(m) 時間です。各 record の classifier は current Phase 1 registry が固定 4 operation source identity なので O(1) です。
//: - candidate table 構築の重複検査や method body fact 構築の計算量は既存 candidate builder の契約に従います。この module では追加の探索 index を持ちません。
//: - record table / builder input table は `Vec` owner table なので push は償却 O(1) 時間です。operation 別 bucket や sorted index は、typed input / owner / error contract を保って後続で置換できます。
//:
//: neplg2:test[stdio, normalize_newlines]
//: stdout: mlstr:
//: ##: Checked [ok,ok,ok,ok,ok,ok,ok,ok]
//: ##: [0] ok
//: ##: [1] ok
//: ##: [2] ok
//: ##: [3] ok
//: ##: [4] ok
//: ##: [5] ok
//: ##: [6] ok
//: ##: [7] ok
//: exit_code: 0
//: ```neplg2
//:| #entry main
//:| #target std
//:| #import "core/result" as *
//:| #import "neplg2/core/check/module/memo_trait_operation_classifier" as *
//:| #import "neplg2/core/check/module/memo_trait_operation_impl_candidate_builder" as *
//:| #import "neplg2/core/check/module/memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer" as *
//:| #import "neplg2/core/ty/ty/memo_trait_operation_evidence" as *
//:| #import "std/test" as *
//: fn main %impure fn void i32 \void:
//:     match selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_stage0:
//:         Result::Ok summary:
//:             let checks0 checks_new
//:             let checks1 checks_push checks0 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_accepted_len_eq summary.accepted 3
//:             let checks2 checks_push checks1 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_accepted_operation_present_eq summary.accepted SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind::Copy
//:             let checks3 checks_push checks2 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_accepted_operation_present_eq summary.accepted SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind::Eq
//:             let checks4 checks_push checks3 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_accepted_operation_present_eq summary.accepted SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind::Hash
//:             let checks5 checks_push checks4 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_classifier_rejected_result_eq summary.untrusted_rejected SelfhostMemoTraitOperationClassifierErrorKind::TraitSourceNotTrusted SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind::Copy
//:             let checks6 checks_push checks5 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_candidate_builder_rejected_result_eq summary.duplicate_rejected SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplCandidateBuilderErrorKind::CandidateDuplicate
//:             let checks7 checks_push checks6 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_drop_unsupported_result_eq summary.drop_unsupported 0
//:             let checks8 checks_push checks7 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_generic_unsupported_result_eq summary.generic_unsupported
//:             let shown checks_print_report checks8
//:             checks_exit_code shown
//:         Result::Err _setup:
//:             let checks0 checks_new
//:             let checks1 checks_push checks0 Result::Err "public impl materializer stage0 setup failed"
//:             let shown checks_print_report checks1
//:             checks_exit_code shown
//: ```

#import "alloc/collections/vec" as v
#import "core/field" as field
#import "core/math" as *
#import "core/option" as *
#import "core/result" as *
#import "core/traits/copy" as *
#import "neplg2/core/hir/hir" as *
#import "neplg2/core/infra/span" as *
#import "neplg2/core/syntax/ast/module_ast" as *
#import "neplg2/core/ty/ty/id" as *
#import "neplg2/core/ty/ty/memo_trait_operation_evidence" as *
#import "./memo_trait_operation_classifier" as *
#import "./memo_trait_operation_impl_candidate_builder" as *
#import "./memo_trait_operation_impl_table" as *
#import "./memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_record" as *
#import "./memo_trait_public_impl_generic_binder" as *
#import "./memo_trait_public_impl_generic_materializer_connector" as *
#import "./memo_trait_public_impl_header" as *

//: SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerRecordTable: typed materializer record の owner table
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `records` は owner buffer です。materializer public API は borrow で読み、閉じません。
//: - この table は session-local public impl materialization 結果です。永続 artifact key や public surface hash の authority ではありません。
pub struct SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerRecordTable:
    records %Vec SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerRecord

//: SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerAcceptedSummary: accepted path の代表結果
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - stage0 doctest が output candidate table owner を閉じた後でも、candidate 数と operation 別 lookup 結果を確認できるようにします。
pub struct SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerAcceptedSummary:
    len %i32
    copy_candidate %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplCandidate SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTableErrorKind
    eq_candidate %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplCandidate SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTableErrorKind
    hash_candidate %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplCandidate SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplTableErrorKind

//: SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind: public impl materializer 境界の拒否理由
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - source record table setup、builder input table setup、source read、classifier rejection、builder input push、candidate builder rejection を typed enum として保持します。
pub enum SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind:
    RecordTableAllocFailed %StdErrorKind
    RecordPushFailed %StdErrorKind
    BuilderInputTableAllocFailed %StdErrorKind
    SourceReadFailed %i32
    GenericConnectorReadFailed %i32
    GenericConnectorMissing %i32
    GenericConnectorDuplicate %i32
    HeaderRejected %SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplHeaderErrorKind
    GenericImplInstantiationUnsupported
    GenericConnectorRejected %SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericMaterializerConnectorErrorKind
    ClassifierRejected %SelfhostMemoTraitOperationClassifierErrorKind
    BuilderInputPushRejected %SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplCandidateBuilderErrorKind
    CandidateBuilderRejected %SelfhostMemoTraitOperationImplCandidateBuilderErrorKind

//: SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerStage0Summary: materializer smoke の代表結果
pub struct SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerStage0Summary:
    accepted %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerAcceptedSummary SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind
    untrusted_rejected %Result i32 SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind
    duplicate_rejected %Result i32 SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind
    drop_unsupported %Result i32 SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind
    generic_unsupported %Result i32 SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerAcceptedSummary:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerAcceptedSummary SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerAcceptedSummary \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerAcceptedSummary:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerAcceptedSummary SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerAcceptedSummary \self:
        self

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind \self:
        self

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerStage0Summary:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerStage0Summary SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerStage0Summary \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerStage0Summary:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerStage0Summary SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerStage0Summary \self:
        self

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_record_table_new: [空/から]の materializer record table を[作/つく]る
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_record_table_new %impure fn void Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerRecordTable StdErrorKind \void:
    let records_result %Result Vec SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerRecord StdErrorKind v::new
    match records_result:
        Result::Ok records:
            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerRecordTable records
        Result::Err e:
            Result::Err e

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_record_table_free: materializer record table の owner buffer を[閉/と]じる
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_record_table_free %impure fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerRecordTable unit \table:
    v::free field::get table "records"

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_record_table_len: materializer record 数を[返/かえ]す
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_record_table_len %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerRecordTable i32 \table:
    let records %&Vec SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerRecord field::get_ref table "records"
    v::len records

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_record_table_push: materializer record を table に[追加/ついか]する
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `table` はこの関数が消費します。成功時は追加後の owner を返します。
//: - push 失敗時は `Vec` が返した owner を閉じ、`RecordPushFailed(error)` として `StdErrorKind` を保持します。
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_record_table_push %impure fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerRecordTable impure fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerRecord Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerRecordTable SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind \table\record:
    let records %Vec SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerRecord field::get table "records"
    match v::push records record:
        Result::Ok next_records:
            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerRecordTable next_records
        Result::Err e:
            let error %StdErrorKind field::get e "error"
            v::free v::vec_push_error_vec e
            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind::RecordPushFailed error

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_header_input: materializer record から public impl header input を[作/つく]る
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - header field は record の typed payload だけから写します。source declaration text や module path へ戻りません。
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_header_input %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerRecord SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplHeaderInput \record:
    selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_header_input_new record.visibility record.module_fingerprint record.declaration_ordinal record.impl_kind record.target_type_shape_hash record.trait_application_shape_hash record.type_parameter_count record.type_parameter_bound_count record.generic_binder_evidence

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_trait_application_input: materializer record から classifier input を[作/つく]る
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_trait_application_input %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerRecord SelfhostMemoTraitOperationTraitApplicationInput \record:
    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_trait_application_input_new record.trait_source record.trait_type_argument_count record.trait_application_shape_hash

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_record_declaration_ordinal_result: record の public declaration ordinal を[取/と]り[出/だ]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_record_declaration_ordinal_result %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerRecord Result i32 SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind \record:
    match record.declaration_ordinal:
        Option::Some ordinal:
            if:
                eq ordinal 0
                then:
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind::HeaderRejected SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplHeaderErrorKind::DeclarationOrdinalPlaceholder
                else:
                    if:
                        lt ordinal 0
                        then:
                            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind::HeaderRejected SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplHeaderErrorKind::DeclarationOrdinalNegative
                        else:
                            Result::Ok ordinal
        Option::None:
            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind::HeaderRejected SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplHeaderErrorKind::DeclarationOrdinalMissing

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_shape_option_result: shape hash option を[検査/けんさ]して[取/と]り[出/だ]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_shape_option_result %fn Option i32 fn SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplHeaderErrorKind fn SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplHeaderErrorKind Result i32 SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind \shape\missing_error\placeholder_error:
    match shape:
        Option::Some value:
            if:
                eq value 0
                then:
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind::HeaderRejected placeholder_error
                else:
                    Result::Ok value
        Option::None:
            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind::HeaderRejected missing_error

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_generic_connector_lookup_loop: declaration ordinal に対応する generic connector input を[探/さが]す
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - 複数の input が同じ declaration ordinal を持つ場合は first-wins にせず `GenericConnectorDuplicate` で拒否します。
//: - 読み取り失敗は `GenericConnectorReadFailed(index)` として typed payload に残します。
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_generic_connector_lookup_loop %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericMaterializerConnectorInputTable fn i32 fn i32 fn Option SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericMaterializerConnectorInput Result SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericMaterializerConnectorInput SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind \source\declaration_ordinal\index\found:
    if:
        ge index selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_generic_materializer_connector_input_table_len source
        then:
            match found:
                Option::Some input:
                    Result::Ok input
                Option::None:
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind::GenericConnectorMissing declaration_ordinal
        else:
            match selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_generic_materializer_connector_input_table_get source index:
                Option::Some input:
                    if:
                        eq input.declaration_ordinal declaration_ordinal
                        then:
                            match found:
                                Option::Some _already:
                                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind::GenericConnectorDuplicate declaration_ordinal
                                Option::None:
                                    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_generic_connector_lookup_loop source declaration_ordinal add index 1 some input
                        else:
                            selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_generic_connector_lookup_loop source declaration_ordinal add index 1 found
                Option::None:
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind::GenericConnectorReadFailed index

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_generic_connector_for_record_result: record と matching connector input から evidence を[作/つく]る
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - input table は final evidence を保持しません。matching input を見つけた後、materializer record を渡して connector module の `connector_result` を必ず実行します。
//: - `evidence_recheck_result` は producer provenance の代替ではなく、防御的な field consistency check です。producer 境界はこの関数内の `connector_result` 呼び出しです。
//: - record の original target / trait shape と evidence の pre-substitution shape を照合し、別 declaration 用 input の混入を防ぎます。
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_generic_connector_for_record_result %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerRecord fn &SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericMaterializerConnectorInputTable Result SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericMaterializerConnectorEvidence SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind \record\connectors:
    match selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_record_declaration_ordinal_result record:
        Result::Ok declaration_ordinal:
            match selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_generic_connector_lookup_loop connectors declaration_ordinal 0 none:
                Result::Ok input:
                    match selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_generic_materializer_connector_result record input.bound_status input.instantiation input.projection_connector input.coherence:
                        Result::Ok evidence:
                            match selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_generic_materializer_connector_evidence_recheck_result evidence:
                                Result::Ok checked:
                                    if:
                                        not selfhost_type_id_eq record.type_id checked.type_id
                                        then:
                                            let mismatch %SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericMaterializerConnectorMismatch selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_generic_materializer_connector_mismatch_new selfhost_type_id_index record.type_id selfhost_type_id_index checked.type_id
                                            let connector_error %SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericMaterializerConnectorErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericMaterializerConnectorErrorKind::MaterializerConnectorShapeHashMismatch mismatch
                                            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind::GenericConnectorRejected connector_error
                                        else:
                                            if:
                                                not eq record.module_fingerprint checked.module_fingerprint
                                                then:
                                                    let mismatch %SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericMaterializerConnectorMismatch selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_generic_materializer_connector_mismatch_new record.module_fingerprint checked.module_fingerprint
                                                    let connector_error %SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericMaterializerConnectorErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericMaterializerConnectorErrorKind::MaterializerConnectorShapeHashMismatch mismatch
                                                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind::GenericConnectorRejected connector_error
                                                else:
                                                    match selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_shape_option_result record.target_type_shape_hash SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplHeaderErrorKind::TargetTypeShapeHashMissing SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplHeaderErrorKind::TargetTypeShapeHashPlaceholder:
                                                        Result::Ok target_shape:
                                                            if:
                                                                not eq target_shape checked.pre_substitution_target_type_shape_hash
                                                                then:
                                                                    let mismatch %SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericMaterializerConnectorMismatch selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_generic_materializer_connector_mismatch_new checked.pre_substitution_target_type_shape_hash target_shape
                                                                    let connector_error %SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericMaterializerConnectorErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericMaterializerConnectorErrorKind::RecordTargetShapeConnectorMismatch mismatch
                                                                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind::GenericConnectorRejected connector_error
                                                                else:
                                                                    match selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_shape_option_result record.trait_application_shape_hash SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplHeaderErrorKind::TraitApplicationShapeHashMissing SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplHeaderErrorKind::TraitApplicationShapeHashPlaceholder:
                                                                        Result::Ok trait_shape:
                                                                            if:
                                                                                not eq trait_shape checked.pre_substitution_trait_application_shape_hash
                                                                                then:
                                                                                    let mismatch %SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericMaterializerConnectorMismatch selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_generic_materializer_connector_mismatch_new checked.pre_substitution_trait_application_shape_hash trait_shape
                                                                                    let connector_error %SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericMaterializerConnectorErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericMaterializerConnectorErrorKind::RecordTraitApplicationShapeConnectorMismatch mismatch
                                                                                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind::GenericConnectorRejected connector_error
                                                                                else:
                                                                                    Result::Ok checked
                                                                        Result::Err trait_error:
                                                                            Result::Err trait_error
                                                        Result::Err target_error:
                                                            Result::Err target_error
                                Result::Err connector_error:
                                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind::GenericConnectorRejected connector_error
                        Result::Err connector_error:
                            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerErrorKind::GenericConnectorRejected connector_error
                Result::Err e:
                    Result::Err e
        Result::Err e:
            Result::Err e

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_generic_header_input: generic connector evidence から concrete header input を[作/つく]る
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - candidate builder へ渡す header は concrete target / trait shape を持つ monomorphic header として作ります。
//: - original generic binder evidence は connector evidence 側で検査済みであり、builder input へ count-only generic header として持ち込みません。
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_public_impl_materializer_generic_header_input %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPublicImplMaterializerRecord fn SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericMaterializerConnectorEvidence SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplHeaderInput \record\evidence:
